{"resourceIdentifier":"4411","resourceName":"Xinzhou Echeng Afforestation Project","description":"Xinzhou Echeng Afforestation Project (hereafter as “the project”) locates in Echeng County, Xinzhou City, Shanxi Province of North China. It aims to address climate change and promote sustainable development in the region. The project involves planting trees on barren mountains to increase carbon sequestration, which can help mitigate the effects of climate change by removing CO2. Aside from the environmental benefits, the project can also have positive economic impacts on the local community by providing employment opportunities for residents and contributing to local economic development. The project was implemented by the project proponent Jingle County Sailing Carbon Sink Development Co. Ltd.\r\nA total of 39,589.87 ha of forest will be planted through direct planting on previously barren lands in Echeng County. The project will cover 6 towns,6 townships and 223 administrative villages. The project sites have not undergone any natural renewal or afforestation prior to the implementation of the project. \r\nThe project is expected to generate GHG emission removals of 19,966,354 tCO2e in 60 years, with an average annual GHG emission removal of 332,773tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":38.359036,"longitude":111.939440},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-06-09","endExclusive":"2023-07-10","endInclusive":"2023-07-09"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4411"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shanxi"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jingle County Sailing Carbon Sink Development Co. LTD"},{"type":"string","value":"Shanxi Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string",